      <td style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:middle;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="font-size:7.5pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:DM Sans;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:'DM Sans',serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">An amount equal to 12 months of the Company&#8217;s share of healthcare benefit premiums, payable over 3 months;</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:'DM Sans',serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></td>
